3. What the Cooperative may do

Once the agreed development price has been paid in full, the Cooperative may
use and run this website for its own business, for as long as it wishes. This
right is non-exclusive and cannot be sold, transferred or sublicensed.

The Cooperative may not, without the Developer's written consent:

  - copy, modify or reuse the code or design for any other website, app or
